WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.975
Build your game in milestones, and play it after each one.

2
00:00:04.752 --> 00:00:09.177
First the core loop: a player, something to collect, a danger, a score.

3
00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:13.780
Then a way to win and lose. Then one piece of polish.

4
00:00:16.288 --> 00:00:19.638
Then watch someone else play it, and change one thing.
